izable click speed, burst options, and remote execution.\n- **Auto Loot** — Automatically teleports to drops, filters by rarity and sell price, and lets you adjust the scan radius.\n- **Auto Sell** — Sells your backpack when it’s full. You can toggle a pause if you want to manually sort out rares.\n\n**Progression & Upgrades**\n\n- **Auto Rebirth** — Rebirths instantly as soon as you hit the required level.\n- **Auto Upgrade** — Automatically buys upgrades (Speed, Carry, Attack Speed, Attack Range). You can toggle each one individually.\n- **Auto Buy Gear** — Buys Cutters and Auras from the shop for you. Just pick from the dropdown or type in what you want.\n\n**World & Travel**\n\n- **Travel Worlds** — Quickly teleports you to any unlocked world (1–6). Shows the level requirement live so you don’t accidentally trigger anti-cheat.\n- **Level Indicator** — Real-time display showing your current level vs. the level needed for your selected world.\n\n**Misc**\n\n- **Unstuck** — Instantly teleports you back to base if you get stuck in a wall or fall through the map.\n- **FPS Boost** — Hides nearby grass to help performance, especially on mobile.\n- **Anti-AFK** — Keeps you from getting kicked while farming.\n- **Auto Rejoin** — Automatically reconnects if you get disconnected.\n\n---","tags":["Popular","Auto farm","Undetected","Op","Script"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/yJbc5te4Xj","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6930737bf0170c0a5193fd1c","username":"Pearl_scripts","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f042566fc2508acab27b1a613084ce90de02704eaefa8a1360b85369c162a75a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6930737bf0170c0a5193fd1c-1782038472796.jpg"},"lvl":11,"status":"offline","id":"6930737bf0170c0a5193fd1c","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.chart_topper","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f042566fc2508acab27b1a613084ce90de02704eaefa8a1360b85369c162a75a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6930737bf0